    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64ace7ce749a9569e02cb201",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "約4か月の短い期間に全てを走る\n過酷極まるローテーションだが、\n出走ウマ娘には時代の最上位が集う。",
      "source_fingerprint": "317c425e70f0b8291041dc86661caa2756b8c88e0c203b062b18d0e89ea8ddb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119312.json",
      "json_path": [
