    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2b32e2d70c20c592207d3b2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "メジロ家との繋がりを経て、己の壁を越え、\n長距離GⅠでも十分に戦えた今の彼女なら、\nきっとこの過酷なローテーションも走れる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a56fcac6d3d187728bf6a321c28b6c385089d7ffea33623d6354ff0c23b6172",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119312.json",
      "json_path": [
